AUDIO: 'and fix what it finds. Okay. Now for the big one, workflows. So, here\'s the pitch. Everyone who works with databases has that one task. Every'

[03:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Monday morning, you open the same table, apply the same filter, and export the results to JSON. Again, for the 400th time, it takes 10 minutes, it\'s mind-numbing, and a small'

[03:55] [scene:ui]
