AUDIO: 'part of you dies every single week. Workflows in DB Pro exist to keep that part of you alive. Workflows let you automate the tasks you do on repeat right inside DB Pro. So,'

[04:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'here\'s how it works. You create a new workflow, and you land in the workflow editor. It\'s a drag-and-drop node editor, and you\'ve got a whole palette of nodes to'

