[04:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to Monday at 9:00 a.m. Wire in a query node, wire that into a save to file node, set it to JSON, and done. You can also run the workflow right inside DB Pro.'

[04:46] [scene:talk]
